            <h1 class="pixel">ABOUT</h1>
            <p>I'm Kartik Luke Singh. I build Shopify apps as co-founder and CTO of <a href="https://artossoftware.com">Artos Software</a>, a small, remote studio. Our apps, <a href="/stoq/">STOQ</a>, <a href="/filemonk/">Filemonk</a> and <a href="/invoice-falcon/">Invoice Falcon</a>, run on tens of thousands of Shopify stores.</p>
            <p>I co-founded <a href="/jobspire/">Jobspire</a> while studying at Manipal Institute of Technology, then led engineering teams at JustCode, LetsVenture, Reflektive and CoLearn before starting Artos Software.</p>
            <p>I write about what we learn building Shopify apps at <a href="/writing/">fluke.md/writing</a>. I live in Bangalore and I'm a dad to two dogs.</p>
            <p>The best way to reach me is a DM on <a href="https://x.com/0xfluke" rel="me noopener">X</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kartikluke/" rel="me noopener">LinkedIn</a>. How this site handles analytics is on the <a href="/privacy/">privacy</a> page.</p>
